# CODEOWNERS — rename this file to `.github/CODEOWNERS` and replace the
# example owners with real teams/users. Until then it is inert.
#
# With branch protection ("Require review from Code Owners"), a matching
# path forces the right reviewer before merge. Use it to turn the security
# sign-off into a required review instead of a suggestion.

# Repo baseline — every change needs one of these reviewers:
# *                     @your-org/maintainers

# Sensitive surfaces — force the security sign-off gate:
# /auth/                @your-org/security
# /payments/            @your-org/security
# /billing/             @your-org/security
# /uploads/             @your-org/security
# /webhooks/            @your-org/security
# /.env.example         @your-org/security
# **/.env*              @your-org/security

# Agent instructions — changes to the loop itself need a maintainer:
# /AGENTS.md            @your-org/maintainers
# /.agents/             @your-org/maintainers
# /.github/workflows/   @your-org/maintainers
